OL,3,GNEWSA'Revolutionary' toolkit helps
OL,4,Apupils stay focused
OL,5,
OL,6,FMovement breaks and fidget tools are
OL,7,Famong the strategies being used to help
OL,8,Fsome children stay focused in the
OL,9,Fclassroom.
OL,11,FA Devon primary school described the
OL,12,Fnew teacher resources, called the Flex
OL,13,Ftoolkit, as "revolutionary" in
OL,14,Fsupporting pupils, particularly those
OL,15,Fwho struggled with attention,
OL,16,Fimpulsivity and hyperactivity.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
