OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Revolutionary' toolkit helps
OL,4,Apupils stay focused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe toolkit was co-designed by
OL,7,Fresearchers at the University of
OL,8,FExeter, alongside the Tools for Schools
OL,9,FPlanning Group, to help children,
OL,10,Fparticularly those with Attention
OL,11,FDeficit Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD),
OL,12,For traits of, engage with learning.
OL,14,FProject lead Abby Russell, associate
OL,15,Fprofessor in child and adolescent
OL,16,Fmental health, said the website the
OL,17,Ftool were available from was
OL,18,Fspecifically designed for primary
OL,19,Fschools and could be used by any
OL,20,Fteacher without specialist training.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
